      "releaseNotes": "The new version of the app allows students who are enrolled in eligible AP courses (and provided their mobile phone number) to access the app. They can unlock personalized guidance to explore college and career pathways using AP courses and previous SAT/PSAT-related assessments. We’ve also enhanced the career guidance with updates to career and skill profiles and additional personalized insights. The explore homepage, overall app performance, and other bugs have been improved as well.",
