      "description": "Discover majors, colleges, and careers that might align with your goals and interests. See how the skills you may be developing can lead to future pathways.\n\nBigFuture School is a free mobile app that helps you explore colleges and careers, see how your skills may connect to future options, and get personalized guidance, all in one place. It is available to you if you are 13 or older in a participating U.S. school and you take an in-school SAT or PSAT assessment and/or are enrolled in eligible AP courses*. You can easily view your in-school SAT Suite score(s) in the app.\" Can we revise to \"You can easily view your score(s) in the app from any in-school SAT or PSAT-related test.\n\nTo access the app, you’ll need to use the mobile number you initially provided. This account information is separate from your College Board account.\n\nIf Connections** is offered at your school, it is an optional feature for you to discover nonprofit colleges, scholarship providers, and government agencies administering educational programs that may be a good match and are actively looking for students like you.\n\nLearn more about BigFuture School and how to access it: bigfutureschool.org\n\n*BigFuture School is not offered to students as part of their AP course participation in New York. There may be other exceptions.\n\n**A school, district, or state may choose to not provide access to Connections. Connections is not available to 8th grade PSAT 8/9 test takers or in New York.",
